WEBVTT

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:12.000
Hey...

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.330
Come on in.

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.170
You know what?

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.920
What is this about?

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.540
I heard about something incredibly shocking...

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:05.000
The Gray Witch

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:47.580
The venue is on the other side of that waterway.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:48.630
Oh, yeah?

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.630
What's over there?

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.960
A library.

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:54.580
And over there,

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.040
there's no worry of running into
the house mother out on patrol.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:36.440
To all of you students representing d'Autriche,

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.440
I am grateful you accepted the invitation

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:42.930
from
St. Friedeswiede and are here with us this evening.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.250
The feeling is mutual.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:47.920
Thank you for inviting us.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.500
Well then, everyone, raise a glass.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:59.210
We shall now hold the unofficial closing
party for the Luna Lumiere tournament!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:01.210
Alcohol...?

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.880
How indecent.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.500
It's juice, of course.

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.040
It's good.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.270
All of you new students,

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.330
even more so than the storied social
gathering hosted by the academy,

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:24.380
this unofficial closing party that we
ourselves put on is worth your while.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.210
Take it all in and see for yourselves.

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:29.330
Keira is just lovely!

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:34.000
Much like the official gathering,
with its long-standing history,

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:36.290
this night party is also a traditional event,

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:41.250
that has been continuously handed
down by our seniors at the school.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:45.680
Shenfa is once again looking
even more beautiful tonight.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.880
I had no idea.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.000
Never imagined that there was
an unofficial closing party...

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.750
Secrets make my heart race with excitement, you know?

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.170
You enjoying yourselves?

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:15.540
The two Miss Angels.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:26.040
You know, my victory this time wasn't a
show of praise for my actual ability.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.460
I can't call it a true victory.

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:33.530
Next time, I will sear into all of your minds a result that is

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:36.040
clear as day for any who witness it.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.710
I-I see.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:40.330
With all due respect, Keira...

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:44.420
Speaking as a lover of numerous novels,

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:50.080
talking with so much confidence about a
match that is still in the distant future

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:52.960
is something one should be most careful about.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:54.830
Is that so?

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.790
Well, when one makes a declaration of their own victory,

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.750
it livens things up all the more, right?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.830
That Keira isn't the type to belie expectations, you know?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:11.960
I wonder how things will turn out next year...

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:16.420
No matter what situation we find ourselves in,
I'll do a great job of supporting you, Lita.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.290
Thank you, Elli!

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:34.280
It's no use thinking about next year at this time.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.040
Right now, it's okay to just kick
up your heels for the moment.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.000
You do have a point.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.460
What do you wanna do for fun?

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:48.590
Cards?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.750
A pillow fight would also be a standard way to go.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.540
After all, I'd be too embarrassed to
do that back inside a dorm room.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:07:00.000
Ahem! Shouldn't we be a bit more ladylike?

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.130
As far as what's done at times like this,

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:06.420
the answer is... talking about our love lives.

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:07.130
Huh?

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:07.830
"Love"?

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:10.990
Alright, you go first, Melida.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.540
U-uh, well...

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.830
A partner like that is something...

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.750
I've never had so far.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.540
"So far"...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:32.240
Uh, what about yourself Mule?

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:34.290
Naturally, I'm in the same boat as you.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.540
And you, Sala?

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:41.460
I'm shy around people I don't know well,
so romantic love is a bridge too far...

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:45.470
I guess things aren't about to get exciting, after all.

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:47.780
Why aren't you asking me?

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:49.500
Let me see...

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:52.080
Then, let's talk about one of the other standard topics:

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.660
Scary stories.

00:07:54.460 --> 00:07:59.210
Uh, my "little sister" isn't good with that kind of stuff.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:00.970
Relax.

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:06.130
While what I have in mind is a scary story,
it's also a sorrowful love story, you see.

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:11.560
This story is famous in
Aquarimus Heavenly-Mirror District,

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:15.290
which is renowned as the city of water.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.220
Oh, that story...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.250
A long time ago,

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:25.460
there was a husband and wife who moved
to Aquarimus Heavenly-Mirror District.

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.880
Fleeing the land of eternal night,
they came to Flandore seeking a fresh start.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:37.170
However, due to groundless prejudice,
the people of Flandore repeatedly attacked them.

00:08:37.670 --> 00:08:39.670
The husband, who was unable to find adequate employment

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:42.280
and was driven into a corner day after day,

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:45.790
ultimately came to treat his wife harshly.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.000
Even so, the wife endured it all with selfless devotion.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.210
However, one particular day...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.000
the husband, who had at last lost his mind,

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.420
slashed his wife to death with a knife,

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.380
and proceeded to cut out her heart!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.040
Having by now calmed down,

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.750
the husband became terrified of what he had done,

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.520
and he ran off with the heart he had dug out.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:15.000
However, while he was on his way he stumbled
and ended up dropping his wife's heart.

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:19.290
At that moment, a voice said, "My dear, are you hurt?"

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.790
Believe it or not, the heart had spoken to the man!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.250
The man finally came to his senses.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.170
It was then that he understood...

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.670
just how very much his wife had loved him...

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:36.580
and just how much he had done
something that can't be undone.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:40.790
The man embraced his wife's heart,

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.670
and he then proceeded to throw himself into the water.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:48.080
Then, it is said, the two of them departed this life.

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.830
That's a pretty sad story...

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.280
That's your very best scary story?

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.580
No...

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.660
As a matter of fact,

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.370
there is a second half to this tale.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:06.580
It was okay up till the man and his
wife's heart had set off for heaven,

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:11.500
but the body of the wife,
who had lost her heart and been abandoned,

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.340
harbored a deep-seated grudge
and began to move around.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.000
The woman...

00:10:17.330 --> 00:10:20.670
Who was only wandering around
the city to look for her own heart,

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:24.830
at some point came to be called the "Gray Witch."

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.130
"The Gray Witch"...

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:31.420
It's said that night after night she roams about,

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:37.130
attacking pretty young women and
then cutting their hearts out.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.380
Even now...

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:41.170
and always!

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:47.580
G-get a hold of yourself, Elli!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.790
Don't leave me all on my own!
By the looks of how much you enjoyed it,

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.710
it seems telling the story was worthwhile.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.790
B-b-but, it's nothing more than a made-up story, right?!

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.670
I can't believe a heart could actually talk...

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.420
Is that what you think? To tell the truth...

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:05.350
All around Flandore there's been a string of appalling

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:08.060
murders where the victims had their hearts dug out.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:12.000
Are they simply crimes committed for kicks by
someone who was inspired by the tale?

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.400
Or...

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:18.960
What the...?

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.070
I wonder if there's some wind blowing in from outside.

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.420
Pina, bring me some matches.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:29.160
Pina!

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:30.880
Pina is nowhere to be seen.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:31.790
She's vanished!

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.420
"Vanished"?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.500
That can't-

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.460
Who are you?!

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:41.920
And how did you get inside here?

00:11:50.630 --> 00:11:53.290
The Gray Witch...?

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.920
Th-the Gray Witch!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.750
She's come to cut out all of our hearts!

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.420
Everyone, flee for safety!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:17.710
I'll buy some time!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.410
Oh, that's right!

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.580
Not all weapons are things made of steel.

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.940
Isn't that right, Instructor?!

00:12:39.670 --> 00:12:40.920
Everyone, use the shawls!

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.580
Now! Run for it!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:10.420
It seems she's not chasing after us.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.210
Do you think everyone's alright?

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.850
In any case, let's head back to our dorm.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:16.960
Good idea.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:28.540
Could it really be that the woman with
the pointy hat is the Gray Witch?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:29.830
I don't know.

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:33.250
But, Keira got defeated quite easily.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.460
So what's clear is that it was no ordinary person.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:38.350
For heaven's sake!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:40.920
"Witches" are pure fiction.

00:13:41.290 --> 00:13:43.380
So there's no way one actually exists, right?

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.880
If we talk to Instructor Kufa,

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.670
he of all people will know what we're dealing with...

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.190
Wh-what's wrong, Melida?!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:14:00.080
I-I stepped on something.

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:02.530
Something fell from above... and it's squishy.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:03.710
What is it?!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.290
I-I don't know.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:08.540
It's soft, cold, and springy...

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:10.160
Human skin?

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.460
Er, is it perhaps actually...

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.830
entrails...

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:18.670
or the like?

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.380
Let's get out of here ASAP! Hurry!

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:33.330
Oh no! I-I stepped on something!

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.090
I-I did, too!

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.920
Lita, I can't go on any longer.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.520
Elli, get a grip!

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:40.170
My feet feel slimy!

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:41.080
There's more and more of it!
My feet feel slimy!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.040
There's more and more of it!
Elli, pull it together!

00:15:04.080 --> 00:15:05.170
The waterway...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.380
If we can just make it out the end of the waterway...

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.150
If my instructor sees me looking like this...

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.190
How embarrassing!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.710
Nope! Nope! Nope! Nope!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.290
I can't be bothered with this anymore.
I'm taking it off!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.000
Elli, don't do anything rash!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.710
Ah, right in my cleavage...

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:49.710
Oh my, you're in a real fix now, huh, Sala?

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:51.630
I'll help you out.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.130
I will, too.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.040
The fruit of betrayal... peach hunting.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.460
That can't be any fun, right?

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:01.380
I'll get it all off without leaving a single shred,

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.730
so come on and move your
hands out of the way already.

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.040
You're all scaring me!

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.250
Th-the Gray Witch...

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.380
Don't tell me... the older girls...

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:26.920
got wiped out.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.960
I won't let you meddle with any of them!

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.040
Sala!

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.540
Elli?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:52.730
Live a good, strong life for me, Lita.

00:16:52.730 --> 00:16:54.150
What are you saying, Elli?!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.500
Don't resign yourself to losing.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.880
I'm going to fight alongside you.

00:16:59.380 --> 00:17:00.210
Lita...

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.920
Phantom-Blade Flash...

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.000
Wind Fang!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.880
She's powerful.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.540
She's really powerful.

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:18.380
Run!

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.540
Everybody, hurry and get out of here!

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:35.780
If we can make it out of this waterway...

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:43.790
Just a bit farther...

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.080
A bit farther...

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:46.420
Almost there.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.170
If we head to the dorm, my instructor will save us.

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:08.250
She won't pursue us out here?

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.460
Instructor Kufa...

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:12.440
Instructor?

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:14.830
Hello there, young ladies.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.460
Instructor, we're in some serious trouble!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.920
Something terrible has happened!

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:22.000
I won't say bad things about you anymore,
so please save us!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.240
Please, Instructor Kufa!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:25.790
When this is over, I'll serve you as much as you like!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.630
I'm actually in a bind myself right now.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.460
Will you help me search for something?

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:35.500
"Search for something"?

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.260
Yes. I am...

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:43.640
looking for my ripped-out heart.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:59.250
Have you reflected on your conduct, young ladies?

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:01.540
Is that...?

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:03.250
It's tomato sauce.

00:19:05.130 --> 00:19:09.500
I can't believe all of the instructors found
out about the unofficial closing party.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.670
I heard about something incredibly shocking...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:21.710
Word is it takes place after the
housemother finishes her patrols.

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:23.040
What does?

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:26.680
They say that students from Friedeswiede and d'Autriche

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:29.770
gather together and hold some
kind of unofficial closing party.

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:33.020
And... why are you telling me this?

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:35.880
Now that you've heard about it,
you can't just ignore it, right?

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:38.630
Well, right she was.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:42.280
After all, it is the role of a private tutor to see that you young ladies

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.530
maintain order in the academy.

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:49.960
Uh, well... So then, who was the
Gray Witch who appeared in the corridor?

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.130
I had a hunch...

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:53.290
That was Rosetti.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:56.460
She disguised herself and even used face paint.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:20:01.680
In a sense, perhaps she's the one who
most enjoyed the disturbance tonight.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:04.790
What were those weird squishy
things that fell into the waterway?

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.420
That was pixie-gem.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.270
Do you know what that is?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.420
"Pixie-gem"?

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:16.150
It's a toy, you see.

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:17.830
S-so then...

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:22.130
You're the one who made it rain down
from the ceiling like that, Instructor?

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:25.500
Ah, um... I'm sorry about that.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.960
I never thought it would end up causing such a panic.

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:42.170
Instructor, you're dirty-minded!

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.760
Doing such a thing to innocent female students...
How distasteful!

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.020
I can't believe you saw me like that...

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:49.000
Perv, lecher, brute!

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.540
I'm going to tell on you to Instructor Rose!

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.750
Ahem! Which one of us do
you suppose would get scolded?

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.580
You are all now free to return to your rooms.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:13.500
M-my legs...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.210
I can't stand up.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:22.210
Excess excitement and fear, as well as tension...

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.420
Your legs are numb after sitting on
your heels for a long time, huh?

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:28.220
What a predicament.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.960
Jeez, don't you get the picture?

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:33.380
You're going to take responsibility for this, aren't you?

00:21:33.380 --> 00:21:34.380
Instructor...

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.000
Instructor...

00:22:00.960 --> 00:22:02.920
Looks like I'll be staying up all night.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:41.040
Next Episode
No Sign Above nor Below
